title: The Tactics template
intro: A battle ready to play: your knights and archers against the computer's orc warband, turn by turn. No code.
project: Tactics | Skirmish
scene: Battle

chapter: The field | What's in the battle
look: 0, 0, 6
explain: scene | The field | A field of grass, with trees and rocks in the way, painted on a tilemap. Your knights and archers start on the left, the orcs and goblins on the right.
select: Orc
explain: component:TacticsUnit | An orc | Every fighter is a Tactics Unit: how far it walks, how far it hits, and how hard. This orc charges.
select: Goblin 2
explain: field:TacticsUnit.Stance | Stance | This goblin archer holds its ground on the rocks, shooting whatever comes within three cells.
select: Turns
explain: field:TurnOrder.ComputerTeams | The computer plays Red | The turn order has the computer play Red.
explain: field:TurnOrder.DefeatMessage | Defeat Message | When a team loses its last unit, the turn order sends a message: Red Defeated opens the Victory panel, Blue Defeated the Defeat panel.

chapter: A round | You, then the computer
play
wait: 0.8
gameclick: Knight
wait: 0.3
explain: game | Pick and send | Pick the knight: where it can walk lights up blue, and where it could hit, red.
gameclick: Knight + 3, 0
wait: 1
gameclick: Archer
gameclick: Archer + 1, 1
wait: 1
expectat: Archer = -5.5, 2.5
tap: Tab
wait: 0.5
expectvalue: Turns.TurnOrder.Current = Red
say: The rest wait, and Tab ends the turn.
wait: 5
expectvalue: Turns.TurnOrder.Current = Blue
explain: game | The orcs come | The computer moves its units one at a time: the orcs charge across the field, and the goblins keep their places.
stop

chapter: Victory | One orc left
select: Orc 2
select: Ctrl+Orc 3
select: Ctrl+Goblin
select: Ctrl+Goblin 2
menu: Entity > Delete
select: Orc
set: Transform.Position = -4.5, 0.5, 0
set: Health.Current = 1
say: To see how it ends, a battle down to one wounded orc, right next to a knight.
play
wait: 0.8
gameclick: Knight
gameclick: Orc
waitfor: Victory | 5
explain: game | Victory | The last orc falls, Red is defeated, and the Victory panel opens, with Again and Menu.
stop
say: That's the Tactics template: units, a computer opponent and turns, all ready to change into your own battle.
